2:  [{name:'Mara Venn',role:'The overfull mask',glyph:'◉',need:'PERSONA · BOUNDARIES',story:'Mara arrives with a list of everyone she has ever disappointed. “If I stop being useful,” she asks, “will there be anything left of me?” Her hands are still folded neatly in her lap.',tags:['The Caretaker','A borrowed face'],choices:[{title:'Ask what she wants',copy:'Let the polished answer wait. Make room for a private wish.',cost:0,currency:'ink',effects:{persona:7,anima:4,trust:3,insight:1},result:'Mara names a wish that belongs to her alone.'},{title:'Honor the mask, gently',copy:'Thank the role that kept her safe, then loosen its ties.',cost:1,currency:'ink',effects:{persona:3,shadow:3,trust:4},result:'Mara leaves with permission to be more than useful.'}]},
3:  {name:'Ivo Calder',role:'A locked room',glyph:'⌁',need:'SHADOW · ANGER',story:'Ivo has not slept since his brother left. He calls his anger “unseemly” and keeps it tucked beneath an immaculate coat. The room seems to grow colder when he smiles.',tags:['The Exile','A disowned feeling'],choices:[{title:'Give anger a chair',copy:'Meet the feeling without asking it to leave.',cost:0,currency:'ink',effects:{shadow:8,trust:3,insight:1},result:'Ivo listens to his anger; it turns out to be guarding grief.'},{title:'Read the dream aloud',copy:'Follow the black dog in last night’s dream.',cost:1,currency:'ink',effects:{shadow:5,child:3,trust:4},result:'The black dog leads Ivo toward a memory he can finally hold.'}]},
4:  {name:'Noor Bell',role:'The bright exile',glyph:'☼',need:'ANIMA · LONGING',story:'Noor is admired for her certainty. In the greenhouse she admits she has forgotten what she loves. “Everything I choose,” she says, “is a choice someone will approve of.”',tags:['The Seeker','A quiet longing'],choices:[{title:'Walk without a destination',copy:'Invite the body to lead where the mind cannot.',cost:0,currency:'ink',effects:{anima:8,persona:-2,trust:3},result:'Noor finds herself lingering beside a wild, unlabelled flower.'},{title:'Listen for the small voice',copy:'Follow the memory that arrives before explanation.',cost:1,currency:'ink',effects:{anima:4,child:4,insight:1,trust:3},result:'A childhood song returns, imperfect and entirely hers.'}]},
5:  {name:'Eli Ash',role:'The child at the gate',glyph:'✳',need:'CHILD · PLAY',story:'Eli, a retired schoolmaster, has brought a wooden boat he made at nine. He cannot explain why he kept it. He laughs once, then looks embarrassed by the sound.',tags:['The Innocent','A door left open'],choices:[{title:'Make something useless',copy:'Set the timetable aside. Let the hands remember.',cost:0,currency:'ink',effects:{child:8,anima:3,trust:3},result:'Eli makes a crooked second boat and gives it no purpose.'},{title:'Ask the boat where it sails',copy:'Let the image speak in its own strange language.',cost:1,currency:'ink',effects:{child:4,shadow:3,insight:1,trust:4},result:'The boat carries Eli toward a grief he had mistaken for duty.'}]},
6:  {name:'Ada Rook',role:'A perfect garden',glyph:'❋',need:'PERSONA · CONTROL',story:'Ada has arranged every stone in her garden. One stubborn patch of nettles refuses her plan. She speaks of it as a failure, though she visits it every morning.',tags:['The Steward','A necessary wildness'],choices:[{title:'Leave one corner untended',copy:'Invite the unplanned to have a place in the garden.',cost:0,currency:'ink',effects:{persona:-3,shadow:5,anima:3,trust:4},result:'Ada discovers a small violet among the nettles.'},{title:'Ask what the nettles protect',copy:'Approach resistance as a messenger, not an enemy.',cost:1,currency:'ink',effects:{shadow:6,insight:1,trust:3},result:'The nettles mark the place where Ada buried her own ambition.'}]},
